          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How many circuits do I need on a transfer switch?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Count your essential loads: refrigerator, freezer, furnace blower, sump pump, well pump, and a few lighting and outlet circuits. Remember that 240-volt loads such as a well pump use two positions. Six circuits suits a small house on city water; ten suits most other homes."
