          For most homes with a 30-amp portable generator, the Generac HomeLink 6853 kit is the manual transfer switch to buy, because it arrives prewired with the inlet box and cord and can later become part of a standby setup. If your generator has a 50-amp outlet, step up to Reliance's 510C. The rest of this guide is about matching the switch to the generator plug and getting it installed legally, which matters more than the brand.
