            If your generator has a 50-amp outlet, the Reliance 510C, or the outdoor R510A when there is no room indoors, uses all of it. Whatever you choose, match it to the generator's outlet, plan the circuits before the electrician arrives, get the permit and inspection, and test the whole setup once a year.
          </p>
